{"seq":4,"slug":"feedback-loops","title":"Feedback Loops","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-feedback-ingestion","title":"用户反馈的采集与摄入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops/user-feedback-ingestion","wordCount":2566,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"failure-mining","title":"失败样本挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops/failure-mining","wordCount":2890,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"eval-driven-iteration","title":"评测驱动的迭代节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/feedback-loops/eval-driven-iteration","wordCount":2786,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<p>线上用户的每一次点赞、重试与放弃，都是评测体系最廉价也最真实的数据来源。这一章讲如何把显式与隐式反馈系统性地采集进可分析的管道，从线上轨迹中挖掘失败样本并归因分类，再把它们沉淀为 golden 集等评测资产。最终目标是建立一个评测驱动的迭代节奏：每一次改 prompt、调检索或换模型，都有离线回归与线上对比作为依据，而不是凭感觉拍板。</p>\n"}